To adjust BGP path selection on your Nokia 7750 SR when multiple paths are available from different peers, use the following configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp best-path-selection
    deterministic-med
    ignore-router-id
exit
```

### Explanation:
- **`deterministic-med`**: Ensures consistent MED-based path selection by grouping routes by neighbor AS before comparing MED values. This prevents route flapping caused by path arrival order.
  
- **`ignore-router-id`**: Ignores the router ID during best-path selection when paths are otherwise equal. This stabilizes path selection and reduces unnecessary changes.

These commands modify the BGP decision process without enabling ECMP or altering multipath behavior. Apply them directly under the BGP configuration context.
