This command removes Add-Paths support for all address families (including IPv4, VPN, multicast VPN, etc.) at the global BGP instance level. It will reset affected BGP sessions to renegotiate without the Add-Paths capability.

**Important Notes:**  
- Apply this under each BGP group or neighbor if Add-Paths was enabled at those levels (replace `<group-name>` and `<neighbor-ip>` as needed):  
