  configure router bgp group <group-name>
      no add-paths
  exit

  configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <neighbor-ip>
      no add-paths
  exit
  ```  
- BGP sessions using Add-Paths will reset after applying these commands. Schedule accordingly to avoid traffic disruption.  
- Verify with `show router bgp neighbor <ip> capabilities` post-configuration to confirm Add-Paths is disabled.
