```

**Explanation:**  
- `hold-time 120 min 60` sets the local hold time to **120 seconds** (2 minutes) but allows negotiation down to **60 seconds** (1 minute) if the peer requires it.  
- `keepalive 20` sets the keepalive interval to **20 seconds**, ensuring compatibility with the minimum negotiated hold time of 60 seconds (since 20 seconds ≤ 1/3 of 60 seconds).  

This configuration ensures sessions stay alive for up to 120 seconds while maintaining backward compatibility with peers that require faster keepalives.
