## Proposed answer:
To enable the router to automatically adjust packet sizes when receiving "frag needed" ICMP messages during TCP sessions, configure path MTU discovery for BGP sessions:

```cli
configure router
    bgp
        path-mtu-discovery
    exit
exit
```

This sets the DF bit in TCP packets and dynamically lowers the MTU for affected sessions upon receiving ICMP fragmentation notifications.
