Hey, I'm trying to set up a customer scenario where my Nokia 7750 needs to grab routes marked as shareable from a secondary routing table’s BGP info—routes that passed checks from both POLICY_B and POLICY_C—and dump them into the main IPv4 table without any labels, using the existing CUST_A_POLICY rules. Any tips on stitching this together without breaking the base routing?
