To enable both labeled IPv6 unicast and IPv6 multicast VPN over the same BGP session on your Nokia 7750 SR, configure the necessary address families at the BGP group or neighbor level. Here's the CLI command:

**At the group level (applies to all neighbors in the group):**  
```cli
/configure router bgp group <group-name> family label-ipv6 mvpn-ipv6
```

**At the neighbor level (for a specific neighbor):**  
```cli
/configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <neighbor-address> family label-ipv6 mvpn-ipv6
```

### Key points:
1. **`label-ipv6`**: Enables labeled IPv6 unicast routes.
2. **`mvpn-ipv6`**: Enables IPv6 multicast VPN (SAFI 5) for MVPN traffic.
